rpdd-library carries a further note here, because it mirrors Richard
Pavlicek's double-dummy tables and those are not ours to relicense.
Nothing of the kind travels with this crate: it holds code that
reproduces deals from their index, and the dedication above covers all
of it. The tables are at https://github.com/bridge-craftwork/rpdd-library
and, in their original form, at https://www.rpbridge.net/ .
